			(property "Description" "Panasonic AXK6S80347YG -- P5KS series (taller/S-boss family) 0.5mm-pitch 80-pin board-to-board HEADER, 7.0mm mated height. Real part confirmed directly in Panasonic's own P5K/P5KS catalog PDF (mouser.com/catalog/specsheets/AXK.pdf), PRODUCT TYPES table, P5KS section, 80-pin/7.0mm row: Socket AXK5S80347YG / Header AXK6S80347YG. Body A=23.20mm, B=19.50mm (DIMENSIONS page, P5KS 4.0-9.0mm group -- same A/B as the shorter AXK680337YG/AXK580137YG pair, confirming pin pitch/count geometry is shared across mated-height variants within a family). PC land pattern total Y span 6.00mm (catalog's own P5KS-general recommended-PC-board-pattern page, header side; socket side is 6.40mm -- NOT the same 1.2mm gap the shorter P5K family uses, this is a real, catalog-stated, family-specific 0.40mm difference). Pad Y positions/size derived from the real vendor CONN80_AXK5S80347YG_PAN.kicad_mod socket export the user supplied (pcb/libraries/AXK5S80347YG/footprints.pretty/), shifting both rows by the real 0.4067mm socket-to-header span delta (not guessed): row Y -1.995352/+1.997952 (vs socket's real -2.198701/+2.201301), same 0.254 x 2.0066mm pad size. 4 extra corner fixing pads (81-84, matching the vendor socket's own) included for the same reason. Mates with AXK5S80347YG (module/front_end-board side)."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
